  | Test Case ID | Requirement Reference | Title | Preconditions | Test Data | Test Steps | Expected Result |   
  Test Type | Priority | Coverage Classification |                                                              
  | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |                                       
  | **TC-CHK-001** | BUG-1024 | Verify successful checkout with a valid percentage discount coupon applied |    
  1. User is logged in.<br>2. Items are added to the cart.<br>3. Valid percentage coupon exists in DB. |        
  Coupon: `SUMMER20` (20% off) | 1. Navigate to the Cart page.<br>2. Enter `SUMMER20` in the coupon field and   
  click "Apply".<br>3. Verify discount is reflected in the cart total.<br>4. Proceed to Checkout and complete   
  payment details.<br>5. Click "Place Order". | 1. Coupon applies successfully.<br>2. Cart displays correct     
  discounted total.<br>3. Order is placed successfully (HTTP 200/201).<br>4. Order confirmation page is         
  displayed. | Functional / Positive | High | Happy Path |                                                      
  | **TC-CHK-002** | BUG-1024 | Verify successful checkout with a valid fixed-amount discount coupon applied |  
  1. User is logged in.<br>2. Cart total exceeds the coupon fixed value.<br>3. Valid fixed coupon exists in     
  DB. | Coupon: `FLAT10` ($10 off) | 1. Navigate to the Cart page.<br>2. Apply coupon `FLAT10`.<br>3. Proceed   
  to Checkout.<br>4. Click "Place Order". | Order is processed successfully without throwing a 500 Internal     
  Server Error. Confirmation page displayed. | Functional / Positive | High | Business Rules |                  
  | **TC-CHK-003** | BUG-1024 | Verify checkout behavior when applying an expired discount coupon | 1. User is  
  logged in.<br>2. Items are in the cart. | Coupon: `EXPIRED50` (Past expiration date) | 1. Navigate to         
  Cart.<br>2. Apply `EXPIRED50`.<br>3. Proceed to checkout and click "Place Order". | Appropriate error         
  message indicating the coupon is expired is shown. Checkout prevents order placement or recalculates to full  
  price without crashing. | Negative / Error Handling | Medium | Negative Scenario |                            
  | **TC-CHK-004** | BUG-1024 | Verify checkout behavior when applying a coupon that has reached its usage      
  limit | 1. User is logged in.<br>2. Items are in the cart. | Coupon: `MAXEDOUT` (Usage limit exhausted) | 1.  
  Navigate to Cart.<br>2. Apply `MAXEDOUT`.<br>3. Attempt to place order. | System displays an error message    
  stating the coupon usage limit has been reached. No 500 error occurs. | Negative / Error Handling | Medium |  
  Boundary Condition |                                                                                          
  | **TC-CHK-005** | BUG-1024 | Verify checkout behavior when coupon discount reduces cart total to zero        
  ($0.00) | 1. User is logged in.<br>2. Low-cost item in cart. | Coupon: `FREEITEM` (100% off or covers exact   
  item value) | 1. Add item worth $10 to cart.<br>2. Apply $10 off coupon.<br>3. Cart total displays            
  $0.00.<br>4. Click "Place Order". | Order is placed successfully as a free order, bypassing payment gateway   
  or handling zero-dollar transaction cleanly without 500 errors. | Edge Case / Boundary | High | Edge Case /   
  Boundary |                                                                                                    
  | **TC-CHK-006** | BUG-1024 | Verify input validation for invalid/non-existent coupon codes during checkout   
  | 1. User is logged in.<br>2. Items are in the cart. | Coupon: `INVALIDCODE123` | 1. Navigate to Cart.<br>2.  
