  crash. | Input Validation | Medium | Input Validation |                                                       
  | **TC-CHK-007** | BUG-1024 | Regression test: Verify standard checkout without any discount coupon applied   
  | 1. User is logged in.<br>2. Items are in the cart. | N/A (No coupon) | 1. Navigate to Cart.<br>2. Do not    
